<title>FRANCE: Breakdown of French barley export bids.</title>
<headline>Breakdown of French barley export bids.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Grain traders gave the following cumulative breakdown for European Union barley export bids submitted via France on Thursday.</p>
<p>    Cumulative tonnage	Refund cut-off point</p>
<p>					 (Ecus/tonne)</p>
<p>	  25,000			 27.89</p>
<p>	  90,000			 28.89</p>
<p>	 185,000			 29.98</p>
<p>The refund shown in the right-hand column is the cut-off point, or maximum refund, for bids covering the tonnage shown in the left-hand column. -- Paris newsroom +331 4221 5416</p>
</text>
